quote.2=p.e50, Rec 12\\: "continuing aspirin in addition to clopidogrel for up to 1 month is reasonable if the patient has a high thrombotic risk and low bleeding risk"
quote.3=p.e50, Rec 14\\: "DOAC monotherapy may be considered if there is no acute indication for concomitant antiplatelet therapy"
source.1=2023 AHA/ACC CCD Guideline (Virani et al., DOI 10.1161/CIR.0000000000001168), \\u00A74.3.1 Rec 11 (p.e50)
source.2=2023 AHA/ACC CCD Guideline (Virani et al., DOI 10.1161/CIR.0000000000001168), \\u00A74.3.1 Rec 12 (p.e50)
source.3=2023 AHA/ACC CCD Guideline (Virani et al., DOI 10.1161/CIR.0000000000001168), \\u00A74.3.1 Rec 14 (p.e50)
