provenance_type=package_insert_specified
quote.1=p.e55, text 16\\: "The FDA has added a boxed warning to avoid use of omeprazole with clopidogrel as well as other potent CYP 2C19 inhibitors, including esomeprazole."
quote.2=\\u00A75.1\\: "Avoid concomitant use of Plavix with omeprazole or esomeprazole because both significantly reduce the antiplatelet activity of Plavix"
quote.3=\\u00A717\\: "Advise patients daily doses of aspirin should not exceed 100 mg and to avoid taking any other medications that contain aspirin."
quote.4=\\u00A75.2\\: "Avoid concomitant use of ZONTIVITY with strong CYP3A inhibitors or inducers"
quote.5=\\u00A75.6\\: "Avoid concomitant use of XARELTO with known combined P-gp and strong CYP3A inhibitors"
quote.6=\\u00A75.5\\: "P-gp inhibition and impaired renal function are the major independent factors that result in increased exposure to dabigatran"
quote.7=\\u00A77.5\\: "monitor digoxin levels with initiation of or change in BRILINTA therapy"
quote.8=Stomach bleeding warning\\: "take a blood thinning (anticoagulant) or steroid drug"
