quote.1=\\u00A75.3\\: "When possible, interrupt therapy with Plavix for five days prior to such surgery. Resume Plavix as soon as hemostasis is achieved."
quote.2=\\u00A75.2\\: "If possible, Effient should be discontinued at least 7 days prior to CABG."
quote.3=\\u00A75.2\\: "When possible, interrupt therapy with BRILINTA for five days prior to surgery that has a major risk of bleeding."
quote.4=\\u00A72.4\\: "XARELTO should be stopped at least 24 hours before the procedure to reduce the risk of bleeding"
quote.5=\\u00A72.4\\: "ELIQUIS should be discontinued at least 48 hours prior to elective surgery or invasive procedures with a moderate or high risk of unacceptable or clinically significant bleeding"
quote.6=\\u00A717\\: "Tell the doctor performing any surgery or dental procedure to talk to the prescribing physician before stopping ZONTIVITY."
